  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>세<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>개 데<ruby>읻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>뎽<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sXirCehYlh0?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>人生<rt>띤솅ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>風景<rt>헝ˉ곙ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>親像<rt>친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>大海<rt>돠해ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>風湧<rt>헝ˉ옝ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    rin-siêng’e hōng-kièng, chīn-chiṵ-toa-hài’e hōng-yèng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>우時<rt>우시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>猛<rt>뼹ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>우時<rt>우시ˊ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>平<rt>볭ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>親愛<rt>친ˉ애</rt></ruby> <ruby>朋友<rt>볭유ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>小心<rt>쇼ˆ심ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-sí bièng u-sí piéng, chīn-ai pieng-yù lì tio-siô-sîm\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>人生<rt>띤솅ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>環境<rt>환곙ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>乞食<rt>킫ˆ쟣ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>出頭天<rt>춛ˆᄐᅷ틸ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    rin-siêng’e hoan-kièng, khît-jiâh ma-e-chût-thau-thḭ̂\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>怨天<rt>완ˋ틸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>尤人<rt>유띤ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>命<rt>먀-</rt></ruby><ruby>順<rt>순ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>命<rt>먀-</rt></ruby><ruby>䆀<rt>빼ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>一生<rt>읻ˆ솅ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-oàn-thḭ̂ bo-yu-rín, mia-sūn mia-bài lông-si-ît-siêng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一杯<rt>짇붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>酒<rt>쥬ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>兩角<rt>능각ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>銀<rt>끤ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>三不五時<rt>삼ˉ붇ˆ꺼시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>鬥陣<rt>ᄃᅷˋ딘ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-puē-jiù nng-kâk-gín, sām-pût-gor-sí ma-lai-tàu-tīn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>若<rt>나</rt></ruby><ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>跋<rt>봫-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>感情<rt>감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>世界<rt>세ˋ개</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>第一等<rt>데읻ˆ뎽ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    na-bêh-kông-poah-kâm-jiéng, goà si-sè-kai’e te-ît-tièng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>緣分<rt>옌훈ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>註定<rt>주ˋ뎽ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>好漢<rt>호ˆ한</rt></ruby> <ruby>破腹<rt>퐈ˋ박</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>相見<rt>살ˉ길</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-yen-hūn si-jù-tiēng, hô-han phoà-pak lai-sā̰-kḭ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>驚<rt>걀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>風<rt>헝ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>驚<rt>걀ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>湧<rt>옝ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>情<rt>졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>義<rt>끼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>好<rt>호ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>兄弟<rt>햘ˉ디ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-kiā̰-hông m-kiā̰-yèng, u-jiéng u-gī hô-hiā̰-tī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>短短<rt>데ˆ데ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>光陰<rt>겅ˉ임ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>𨑨<rt>칟ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>迌<rt>토ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>趁<rt>탄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>少年<rt>ᄉᆤˋ롄-</rt></ruby><ruby>時<rt>시ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tê-tê-à’e kōng-îm, chît-thó tio-thàn-siàu-lien-sí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>求<rt>규-</rt></ruby><ruby>名利<rt>뼹리ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>了<rt>ᄅᆤˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>時<rt>시ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>千金<rt>쳰ˉ김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>難<rt>란-</rt></ruby><ruby>買<rt>뾔ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>好<rt>호ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>人生<rt>띤솅ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kiu-bieng-lī bo-liâu-sí, chiēn-kîm lan-boê-hô-rin-siêng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一杯<rt>짇붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>酒<rt>쥬ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>兩角<rt>능각ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>銀<rt>끤ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>三不五時<rt>삼ˉ붇ˆ꺼시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>鬥陣<rt>ᄃᅷˋ딘ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-puē-jiù nng-kâk-gín, sām-pût-gor-sí ma-lai-tàu-tīn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>若<rt>나</rt></ruby><ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>跋<rt>봫-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>感情<rt>감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>世界<rt>세ˋ개</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>第一等<rt>데읻ˆ뎽ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    na-bêh-kông-poah-kâm-jiéng, goà si-sè-kai’e te-ît-tièng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>緣分<rt>옌훈ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>註定<rt>주ˋ뎽ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>好漢<rt>호ˆ한</rt></ruby> <ruby>破腹<rt>퐈ˋ박</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>相見<rt>살ˉ길</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-yen-hūn si-jù-tiēng, hô-han phoà-pak lai-sā̰-kḭ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>驚<rt>걀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>風<rt>헝ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>驚<rt>걀ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>湧<rt>옝ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>情<rt>졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>義<rt>끼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>好<rt>호ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>兄弟<rt>햘ˉ디ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-kiā̰-hông m-kiā̰-yèng, u-jiéng u-gī hô-hiā̰-tī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>短短<rt>데ˆ데ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>光陰<rt>겅ˉ임ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>𨑨<rt>칟ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>迌<rt>토ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>趁<rt>탄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>少年<rt>ᄉᆤˋ롄-</rt></ruby><ruby>時<rt>시ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tê-tê-à’e kōng-îm, chît-thó tio-thàn-siàu-lien-sí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>求<rt>규-</rt></ruby><ruby>名利<rt>뼹리ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>了<rt>ᄅᆤˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>時<rt>시ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>千金<rt>쳰ˉ김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>難<rt>란-</rt></ruby><ruby>買<rt>뾔ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>好<rt>호ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>人生<rt>띤솅ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kiu-bieng-lī bo-liâu-sí, chiēn-kîm lan-boê-hô-rin-siêng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>求<rt>규-</rt></ruby><ruby>名利<rt>뼹리ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>了<rt>ᄅᆤˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>時<rt>시ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>千金<rt>쳰ˉ김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>難<rt>란-</rt></ruby><ruby>買<rt>뾔ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>好<rt>호ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>人生<rt>띤솅ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kiu-bieng-lī bo-liâu-sí, chiēn-kîm lan-boê-hô-rin-siêng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n"
